{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665520/extras/693ad4feeead406a4d20439b3b84542a.poster.avif?t=1769557532\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665520/extras/693ad4feeead406a4d20439b3b84542a.webm?t=1769557532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665520/extras/693ad4feeead406a4d20439b3b84542a.mp4?t=1769557532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Catto Pew Pew! is a physics-based shooter game where competitive gameplay, proximity chat, and pure chaos collide. Shoot your opponents into the sky and claim your victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665520/extras/c9999c2acfb172d1eaa850f4871ad0db.poster.avif?t=1769557532\" width=620 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665520/extras/c9999c2acfb172d1eaa850f4871ad0db.webm?t=1769557532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665520/extras/c9999c2acfb172d1eaa850f4871ad0db.mp4?t=1769557532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play your way\u2014whether you're in VR or on PC, cross-platform multiplayer keeps the chaos going. Dive into the mayhem with friends, no matter the device... it's one big party!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665520/extras/821a53d0f126ce15ef037a6797650728.poster.avif?t=1769557532\" width=620 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665520/extras/821a53d0f126ce15ef037a6797650728.webm?t=1769557532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665520/extras/821a53d0f126ce15ef037a6797650728.mp4?t=1769557532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Outplay, outlast, and outrank the competition as you fight your way to the top. Win matches and rack up trophies to climb the ranks and become the ultimate Catto Competitor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665520/extras/95e0ccc221f6e9c1cf8ad3d5b490adc9.poster.avif?t=1769557532\" width=620 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665520/extras/95e0ccc221f6e9c1cf8ad3d5b490adc9.webm?t=1769557532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665520/extras/95e0ccc221f6e9c1cf8ad3d5b490adc9.mp4?t=1769557532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665520?t=1769557532","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665520/c38887b86dade33aad89e8247a93c559b6e68898/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769557532","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665520/dbe7edaf6d0bed25aa86c